cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Utilvo Shield Filters: Network-Level Blocklist & ABP Rule Parser for Ad, Popunder, Tracker, and Malvertising Hosts"
message: "If you use Utilvo Shield Filters or this software package in your research or security tooling, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
version: 1.0.2
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
