repository-code: "https://github.com/utilvo/utilvo-shield-filters"
repository-artifact: "https://utilvo.com/filters/utilvo-shield-filters.txt"
abstract: >-
  Utilvo Shield Filters is a curated network-level blocklist (~19,980 rules in standard Adblock Plus 2.0 / uBlock Origin / AdGuard syntax) and companion parser library maintained by the Utilvo project (https://utilvo.com). It blocks third-party ad networks, popunder redirect chains, tracking beacons, ClickFix fake-CAPTCHA traps, and malvertising domains while preserving first-party site functionality.
